        "question_title": "In \\(\\triangle ABC\\), \\(AD\\) bisects \\(\\angle A\\) and meets \\(BC\\) at \\(D\\). If \\(|AB|=9\\), \\(|AC|=6\\), and \\(|BC|=10\\), find \\(|BD|\\).",
