        "question_title": "Five distinct straight lines pass through a point \\(O\\). In one fixed half-plane, the five consecutive angles between the rays are \\(\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\alpha_3,\\alpha_4,\\alpha_5\\), where \\(\\alpha_1=24^\\circ\\), \\(\\alpha_2=37^\\circ\\), \\(\\alpha_3=41^\\circ\\), and \\(\\alpha_4=28^\\circ\\). Find \\(\\alpha_5\\).",
