        "explanation": "The five consecutive angles in a half-plane form a straight angle, so their sum is \\(180^\\circ\\). Therefore, \\(\\alpha_5=180^\\circ-(24^\\circ+37^\\circ+41^\\circ+28^\\circ)=50^\\circ\\).",
